@host = http://localhost:8080

# ─── Substitua pelo ID retornado no POST /users ───
@userId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000


### 1. Criar usuário
POST {{host}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pedro",
  "salary": 2200
}


### 2. Definir perfil de investimento
# RiskTolerance: Low=0, Medium=1, High=2
# KnowledgeLevel: Beginner=0, Intermediate=1, Advanced=2
PUT {{host}}/api/investment-profile
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "riskTolerance": 0,
  "knowledgeLevel": 0,
  "investmentHorizonMonths": 24
}


### 3. Criar meta financeira
# GoalType: EmergencyFund=0, Purchase=1, Travel=2, Retirement=3, Education=4, Other=5
POST {{host}}/api/goals
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "type": 0,
  "description": "Reserva de emergência (6 meses)",
  "targetAmount": 13200,
  "deadlineMonths": 12
}


### 4. Gerar recomendação de investimento
GET {{host}}/api/recommendations/{{userId}}


### 5. Ver próximo passo sugerido
GET {{host}}/api/recommendations/{{userId}}/next-step


### 6. Listar metas do usuário
GET {{host}}/api/goals/user/{{userId}}


### 7. Buscar usuário por ID
GET {{host}}/api/users/{{userId}}
